@baseUrl = https://localhost:7101

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Home page rows
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/home?region=US

### Search movies and shows together
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/titles/search?query=dune

### Title details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/titles/movie/693134

### Other sites' ratings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/titles/movie/693134/ratings

### SocialMeter reading (seeded posts work without any social credentials)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/socialmeter/movie/693134

### Force a re-pull from Reddit / X
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/socialmeter/movie/693134?refresh=true

### Posts behind the score
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/socialmeter/movie/693134/posts?sentiment=negative&page=1&pageSize=20

### Rebuild the tracked set (current, trending, seasonal, electric titles) now
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/titles/tracked/refresh

### Run the deletion sync now (purges posts deleted/removed at the source, prunes old posts, recomputes scores)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/socialmeter/sync-deletions

### Re-score stored posts after changing the lexicon or trust settings (no source calls)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/socialmeter/rescore

### Cached readings for a batch of titles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/socialmeter/snapshots?keys=movie:693134,movie:558449
